# head-counts v1.0.0

## Forms

### `(vertex …)`

The vertex stage of a pipeline.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:entry` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(fragment …)`

The fragment stage. Optional, because a depth-only pass has none.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:entry` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(constant …)`

A pipeline-overridable constant. Any number of these.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |
| `:value` | `number` | yes | — | — |

### `(render-pipeline …)`

A pipeline whose sections are counted, not just typed.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

Positional children: `form: (vertex …) | (fragment …) | (constant …)`.

| Head | Count |
| --- | --- |
| `vertex` | exactly 1 |
| `fragment` | at most 1 |
| `constant` | any |

### `(section-holder …)`

Same kind, keyed slot: the counts ride along inertly here.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:section` | `form: (vertex …) \| (fragment …) \| (constant …)` | no | — | — |

### `(scratch-pipeline …)`

Open form, same bounded slot: `:open true` does not silence the counts.

Positional children: `form: (vertex …) | (fragment …) | (constant …)`.

| Head | Count |
| --- | --- |
| `vertex` | exactly 1 |
| `fragment` | at most 1 |
| `constant` | any |

Open form: unknown keys are accepted.

### `(buffer …)`

A buffer binding.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:type` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(sampler …)`

A sampler binding.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:type` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(texture …)`

A texture binding.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:sample-type` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

### `(bgl-entry …)`

Exactly one resource: the claim per-head bounds cannot make.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:binding` | `number` | yes | — | — |

Positional children: `form: (buffer …) | (sampler …) | (texture …)`.

| Head | Count |
| --- | --- |
| `buffer` | at most 1 |
| `sampler` | at most 1 |
| `texture` | at most 1 |
| *any of these* | exactly 1 |

### `(cube …)`

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:size` | `number` | yes | — | — |

### `(sphere …)`

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:radius` | `number` | yes | — | — |

### `(data …)`

At most one generator: a ceiling-only set bound.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

Positional children: `form: (cube …) | (sphere …)`.

| Head | Count |
| --- | --- |
| `cube` | any |
| `sphere` | any |
| *any of these* | at most 1 |

## Value kinds

### pipeline-section

One section of a render pipeline, with how many of each are allowed.

Type: `form: (vertex …) | (fragment …) | (constant …)`.

### bgl-resource

The one resource a bind-group-layout entry binds.

Type: `form: (buffer …) | (sampler …) | (texture …)`.

### data-shape-section

The one generator a (data …) may carry, if any.

Type: `form: (cube …) | (sphere …)`.
